  "prefLabel": "En 902.02 Agreement",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 902.02 “Agreement” means the written agreement signed by the host and by each group member as required by RSA 362-A:9, XIV for the purpose of controlling energy costs of the group.\n\nSource. #14568, eff 4-27-26, EXPIRES: 4-27-36",
